SUMMARY:Starman
DTSTART:20260215T213000Z
DTEND:20260215T232000Z
DTSTAMP:20260215T213000Z
UID:aLm4SjFVIS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nJet Propulsion Laboratory scienti
 st\, robotics engineer\, and best-selling science fiction author Gentry Le
 e\, who was on NASA’s Viking and Voyager teams\, discusses his experienc
 es and views on the possibility of extraterrestrial life.  Q&A with Gentr
 y Lee and Director Robert Stone after the February 15 matinee screening\n\
 nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/starman\n\nEstimated start: 13:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
